brothers and sisters  when i became a president in 2019 what  was felt at that time was that  we would need to go a long way with  poland because the atmosphere was cool  in our relations  in our attitudes to  each other  so that's how it was but i wanted to  go  this way the way towards the wands  as quickly as possible  we knew that by nature we are close to  each other both the ukrainians and the  poles i remember my first meetings with  andre duda from meeting to meeting  things were changing the coolness  disappeared  we understood each other  as a ukrainian with a pole as europeans  as friends  as parents who like their families and  understand that our children  should live  in the world of the same shared good  values that they are to live in a world  where nations are independent  where  there is freedom  where family is important  our there is no uh  room for  military aggression  it supposed uh  that number seven brings fortune well  ukraine has seven uh neighbors  does it bring us good fortune well the  whole world knows the answer today  and  the 78 russian children know it best  those who were killed in russian  military attacks  this is the neighbor who brought poverty  and war to our country  the neighbor  who acts without god's blessing  when there is someone who is brutal  in its attack  we need someone you can count on we can  count on when somebody attacks you you  need a friend who will reach out to you  in the early morning on the 24th of  february i had no doubt who such a  person would be who will tell me you  will not be left alone with your enemy  and indeed  this happened i am very grateful to my  polish brothers and sisters who are  supporting us who are with us and this  is not true  on the very first day of the war it was  clear that the ukrainians  it was clear both for the ukrainians and  the polls that there are no borders  between us uh  physical historical personal human  after  the 16 days of this war the ukrainian  duma  and uh  